WEBVTT

00:01:57.480 --> 00:02:01.860
Translation by Yuutaclus.

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:10.600
It's you!

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:13.940
Wait!

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:20.959
XuanXuan is soo cute!

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:23.679
Why are you here?!

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:25.320
You came here to laugh at me right!

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:26.440
Haoyi...

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:28.840
These peoples are scary...

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:38.519
Why are those two here as well?!

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:44.880
XuanXuan! Don't go!

00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:45.959
Nyaan~ <3

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:58.559
Wow, so daring, who's this Cosplayer.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:01.920
Haoyi.

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:03.900
Please don't underestimate me...

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:07.100
You cannot escape my palm.

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:15.000
Lucky we didn't get spotted...

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:19.440
I never expect people like you-

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:20.920
To like this kind of stuff...

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:22.839
That's actually quite cute.

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:27.560
You... still purposely laughed at me...?

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:29.920
It's a compliment.

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:30.920
You can at least-

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:31.839
SHUT UP!

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:33.120
If not for you!

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:34.480
I won't be hiding like this!

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:36.680
Oi big sis! You look good in those-

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:38.160
Why are you hiding?!

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:40.000
I-I see...

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:41.880
Haoyi likes Cat...

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:43.120
I...

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:46.440
Jiang Haoyi, you idiot!

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:48.100
You think I like doing this?!

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:49.840
When I first enroll in school-

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:51.720
Because of our class girls appearance-

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:53.120
They're always being bullied by the boys.

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:55.760
This year's new freshman sure are tall.

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:02.920
WHAT ARE THOSE?!

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:04.040
DAMN IT GO AWAY!

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:08.240
What a shit day...

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:11.240
Bastard...

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:13.280
Go seat over there!

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:14.280
Don't want!

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:15.920
Ugliness is a virus!

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:18.160
Better to keep a distance!

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:19.000
I know right!

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:23.240
Sorry~

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:25.600
I thought it was some trash the wind brought.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:27.240
It's was you guys huh.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:28.420
What are those dirty stuff.

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:30.680
It belongs in the trash!

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:32.260
SHUT UP!

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:37.200
You bunch of bullies!

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:38.920
Know your limit!

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:00.520
Always being bullied by those boys...

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.120
Don't you guys know how to retaliate?

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:04.160
Big sis!

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:05.920
We're going to follow you for sure!

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:08.520
I had finally protected-

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:09.760
The girls position in the school!

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:11.680
Now everyone thinks of me as their role model!

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:13.960
If they found out that I am doing this...

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:16.960
To think that you like to please men with that getup-

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:18.940
You've been playing us the whole time!

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:22.039
No! Listen to me!

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:24.640
It will turn out like that...

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:27.000
Although your intention is good for others.

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:29.599
But you're still tricking others.

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:32.920
You should show your true self in-front of them

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:34.560
And not hide like this.

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:37.500
I know you this cold-blooded person-

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:38.740
Can never understand me.

00:05:40.760 --> 00:05:42.120
You damn Capricorn!

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:43.560
I hate you!!!

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:46.000
Again?

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:48.440
Say what does Capricorn have to do with me...

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:51.679
Now I'm proud to announce!

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:53.240
River's City 12th-

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:54.600
Female Cosplay competition.

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:56.320
It's about to start!

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:58.200
Excuse me.

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:00.400
Looks like the competition is starting soon.

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:01.400
It's useless...

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:01.900
(MUDA!)

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:04.200
This competition needs 3 person else you can't participate.

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:05.760
In order to retain my nickname.

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:07.760
I always come alone.

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:09.640
