00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:14.200
I see...

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:20.680
We're just about 3 person no?

00:06:21.720 --> 00:06:22.560
Ahh, Miss...

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:23.979
Can you not-

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:27.280
Really!?

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:28.880
For real?! For real!?

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:30.539
Are you kidding me?!?!

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:31.320
I'm a guy!

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:31.980
How can I-

00:06:34.520 --> 00:06:36.240
I have a way~

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:43.840
Don't strip me!

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:44.679
Hurry!

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:45.180
Don't move!

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:45.900
Don't be like this!

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:56.040
Success~

00:06:56.200 --> 00:06:57.599
Nowdays, Trap are the mainsteam.
(YES!!!!!!!!)

00:06:58.000 --> 00:06:59.560
Look at that Waist, Those Legs.

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:00.920
I'm already jealous.

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:02.880
Haoyi~

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:04.320
You're so cute~

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:12.039
